  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这是总编室  (This Is the Chief Editor's Office)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still in the conference room, Chun Yuqiao scolds Wang Er for bringing a green intern to a production meeting. Bu Xiaogu speaks up to ask what the rules are, then worries outside that she was rude. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想带新人随便，但是别带到制作会上来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小朋友才刚开始实习。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是总编室，不是育儿室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室是个讲究效率的地方。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也想问一下，实习多久才可以来这儿工作？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们先沟通好了，以免将来产生误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "见到你的大师兄了，感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚刚是不是太没礼貌了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你甭纠结，他基本上不会记得你是谁。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack this tense first encounter. Chun Yuqiao draws a sharp line for Wang Er.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想带新人随便，但是别带到制作会上来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mentor newcomers all you like, but do not bring them to the production meeting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小朋友才刚开始实习。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The youngster has only just started her internship.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是总编室，不是育儿室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the chief editor's office, not a nursery.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室是个讲究效率的地方。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chief editor's office is a place that cares about efficiency.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也想问一下，实习多久才可以来这儿工作？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would also like to ask: how long must we intern before we may work here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们先沟通好了，以免将来产生误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us communicate clearly first, so we avoid misunderstandings in the future.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "见到你的大师兄了，感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that you have met your senior alumnus, how does it feel?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚刚是不是太没礼貌了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was I way too impolite just now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你甭纠结，他基本上不会记得你是谁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not agonise over it — he basically will not remember who you are.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "想带新人随便，但是别带到制作会上来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小朋友才刚开始实习。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这是总编室，不是育儿室。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室是个讲究效率的地方。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也想问一下，实习多久才可以来这儿工作？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们先沟通好了，以免将来产生误会。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "见到你的大师兄了，感觉怎么样？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚刚是不是太没礼貌了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你甭纠结，他基本上不会记得你是谁。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu stood her ground politely, even if her idol barely glanced her way. You heard \"zhe shi..., bushi...\", \"duojiu\" for \"how long\", and \"mei limao\" for \"impolite\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
